# PlantPulse AI — ML Service Environment Variables
# The FastAPI ML service currently uses no environment variables.
# All configuration is handled via command-line arguments to uvicorn.
#
# If you wish to add configuration in the future (e.g. model paths, ports),
# add them here and load with: from dotenv import load_dotenv; load_dotenv()
#
# Example (not currently used):
# MODEL_DIR=./models
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# PORT=8000
